  "stdout": "reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-04/proposals/chemistry/Ferric_Ammonium_Citrate.after.yaml:14:    notes: Fe(III)NH4-Citrate denotes ferric ammonium citrate. CHEBI:31604 describes this material as an indefinite-composition ferric ammonium citrate mixture, so the existing owner is suitable without inventing a fixed molecular stoichiometry. The explicit FeIII and ammonium qualifiers are retained. Evidence and exact frozen scope are recorded in reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-04/fragments/chemistry-decisions.json. This proposed delta does not approve complete owner/export payload or remove inherited holds.\nreports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-04/proposals/chemistry/Ferric_Ammonium_Citrate.after.yaml:81:  changes: 'Added 5 synonyms from kg-microbe P4.4 enrichment: Ammonium ferric citrate, E381, Fe(NH4)citrate, FerriSeltz, ammonium iron(III) citrate'\nreports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-04/proposals/chemistry/Ferric_Ammonium_Citrate.after.yaml:87:  changes: 'Added 5 synonyms from kg-microbe P4.4 enrichment: Ammonium ferric citrate, E381, FerriSeltz, Ferric Ammonium Citrate, ammonium iron(III) citrate'\ndata/ingredients/unmapped/Trisodium_Citrate_X_3_H2o.yaml:2:preferred_term: Trisodium citrate x 3 H2O\ndata/ingredients/unmapped/Trisodium_Citrate_X_3_H2o.yaml:4:- synonym_text: Trisodium citrate x 3 H2O\ndata/ingredients/unmapped/Trisodium_Citrate_X_3_H2o.yaml:7:- synonym_text: Trisodium citrate·3H2O\ndata/ingredients/unmapped/Trisodium_Citrate_X_3_H2o.yaml:10:- synonym_text: Trisodium citrate・3H2O\ndata/ingredients/unmapped/Trisodium_Citrate_X_3_H2o.yaml:21:  changes: Create unmapped trisodium citrate trihydrate record holding the 3 trihydrate\ndata/ingredients/unmapped/Trisodium_Citrate_X_3_H2o.yaml:39:notes: Trisodium citrate trihydrate surface forms split out from dihydrate Trisodium_Citrate_X_2_H2o\ndata/ingredients/unmapped/Trisodium_Citrate_X_3_H2o.yaml:40:  / Na3-citrate_X_2_H2o (CHEBI:32142) so recipes carrying stale anhydrous term.id\nd